{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_930.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"5bddbe1c7c9c75d54dfb5d44011b41f44829af00d7ae6656a8fbb3f11cbfef05","ja":"輝きのダイヤ……？","zh":"光芒的钻石……？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_930.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"f205298841fe6dfc280db2fe02da9ef3cc847570ce17a900993c48687c9eb2f9","ja":"「世界中のきらめきをつめこんだジュエリーが、\n待望の日本上陸」……とっても素敵♪","zh":"「满载着全世界闪耀光芒的宝石，\n终于登陆日本」……真是太棒了♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_930.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"adbae5e2acca9327c9a3ebdf36d00c1cb10bf2528622c5c6d59ca4e906ca871e","ja":"歌織さん、なんのポスターを見てるの？　\r\nあっ、きれいな宝石……。","zh":"歌织，你在看什么海报？\n啊，好漂亮的宝石……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_930.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"dbc6b71554a71ab3d42484dd4b043b1fc0668c8a40fdb1dc7bef748fdf622108","ja":"あら、なかなか素敵なポスターじゃない♪\nこんな宝石展があるなんて、知らなかったわ。","zh":"哎呀，这海报真不错呢♪\n没想到竟然有这种宝石展，我都不知道呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_930.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"471680abcee0b374e3cc297449a1166bc7ddb0ee614f23f9b8b1956a9a4096b0","ja":"「世界最大級のダイヤも初お披露目」ですって。\nダイヤって聞くと、思い出しちゃうわね。","zh":"\"听说\"世界最大级的钻石也将首次亮相\"。\n一听到钻石，就让人回忆起往事呢。\"","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_930.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"83fbf42fe28798199555439fd9625fc2044b27993320164606cbc7817e50c3f1","ja":"そうね、私たちの公演で使った『輝きのダイヤ』。\nレプリカとはいえ、あれも大きかったものね。","zh":"是啊，我们在演出中使用的《闪耀的钻石》。\n虽然是复制品，那个也很大呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_930.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"c4b171a83bc9c605128ad98765c3257e900ebd27899554ad530457696cfc924d","ja":"ねえ伊織さん。本物のダイヤって、\nやっぱりレプリカとは違うものなの？","zh":"呐，伊织。真正的钻石，\n果然和仿制品不一样吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_930.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"cbe9738c083a7f37902a3f2a4ebb284e0de7de900bd3cc1669b81954731ef2a4","ja":"もちろん♪　本物の輝きは一味違うわよ。\n宝石の中でも、ダイヤはやっぱり特別だもの。","zh":"当然啦♪　真货的光芒就是不一样呢。\n在宝石之中，钻石果然还是特别的呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_930.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"be81a1d305e080c522d9fa282cde3f5c12aac7f481ad61303e7309d56c969c8e","ja":"ふ～ん、そうなんだ……。\n世界最大級だと、どれくらいすごいんだろ……。","zh":"哦～，原来如此……。\n说是世界最大级的，到底有多厉害呢……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_930.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"5f8f2cb6cb444a423d3b4baaa5d931c026410efbefac22cd193850266b599254","ja":"ねえ、せっかくだからみんなで行ってみない？","zh":"嘿，既然机会难得，大家一起去看看？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_930.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"041f01cf8c2c19fda89a714ae6a70ab4ba5a49e0aa78c4ffd48afe36f8cf2774","ja":"桃子は行ってもいいよ。一流のものを\n見ておくのって、芸能人には大切だもんね。","zh":"桃子去也可以哦。见识一流的东西，\n对艺人来说很重要的。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_930.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"882e5d92648dd9c1f71ebd6d162e185684eef2991a9e8fb8ba3306a8a8846040","ja":"私も大丈夫よ。まあ、世界最大級のダイヤといっても、\r\n伊織ちゃんの前ではかすんじゃうかもだけど♪","zh":"我也没问题。不过，就算说是世界最大级的钻石，\n在伊织面前可能也会黯然失色呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
